**Claim Agent** automates the management of customer complaints and non-conformities by monitoring incoming emails, gathering relevant information, and initiating the appropriate quality processes directly within the ERP system.  
The agent can identify the customer, understand the nature of the claim, support replacement or refund scenarios, and facilitate communication throughout the resolution process.

**Key Benefits**

- Automates the intake and processing of customer complaints.
- Reduces manual effort in quality and customer service workflows.
- Accelerates issue resolution and customer response times.
- Ensures consistency and traceability across claim management processes.
- Allows quality teams to focus on corrective actions rather than administrative tasks.

By transforming unstructured customer communications into structured quality processes, **Claim Agent** helps organizations improve efficiency, responsiveness, and customer satisfaction.